---
import Layout from "@layouts/StylesLayout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <h1 class="govuk-heading-xl">Styles</h1>
  <p class="govuk-body">
    This is a collection of styling guidance used across i.AI, covering how to
    structure and present applications consistently.
  </p>
  <p class="govuk-body">
    It has been built using the <a
      href="https://design-system.service.gov.uk/styles/"
      class="govuk-link">GOV.UK Design System</a
    > as a starting point. Only when the initial guidance didn't meet the needs of
    an app we have built have we adapted it or added new guidance.
  </p>
  <p class="govuk-body">
    Every decision about when styles have diverged from GOV.UK has been
    documented in the <a href="/principles" class="govuk-link"
      >principles section</a
    > or can be found in each style's documentation.
  </p>
</Layout>
